 =?UTF-8?q?=20wave's=20sections=20on=20the=20music's=20own=20changes,=20a?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Break=20where=20no=20voice=20sings,=20Intro=20and=20Outro=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?where=20the=20song=20has=20none,=20a=20slice=20of=20the=20spect?=
