Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each section's start moves to the strongest of the lab's changes within 1.5 s (never past its neighbours); where no voice sings for 7 s, a Break (and the section going on after it when the gap falls inside one); a long start or end without a section of its own becomes Intro or Outro. Suite 682/0 (suite-1358.part).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
